          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Related categories</span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment.html\">Medical and surgical equipment</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment/ambulation-and-equipment-management.html\">Ambulation and equipment management</a> | <a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment/clinical-seating.html\">Clinical seating</a></p>\n",
