          "jcr:created": "Wed Feb 21 2024 19:21:53 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">TruRize at a glance</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Early patient mobility is a crucial component during the recovery process. TruRize helps to promote early patient mobility while providing caregivers the assurance they need to safely mobilize their patients.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Six positions (stand assist, recline, upright 1, upright 2, Full-flat transfer position, trend)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Height adjustability</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Integrated chair exit alarm system compliant with IEC 60601-1-8 medium priority alarm</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Pivoting armrests</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Feb 21 2024 19:23:27 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
